<title>USA: Rockaway Twp., N.J., won by First Union.</title>
<headline>Rockaway Twp., N.J., won by First Union.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Union Capital Mkts., said it won $3.300 million of Rockaway Twp., general obligation bonds, with a net interest cost of 4.605 percent.</p>
</text>
